[Music]  do you use hashicorp vault for secrets  management and to define policy as code  and need to deploy a scalable  certificate authority  thanks to an open source backend plugin  you can get these two critical security  tools playing well together  continue your policy as code practice  and keep the same tooling and i'm going  to show you how google's certificate  authority service cas simplifies private  certificate management and runs at scale  if you already use hashicorp vault to  define your certificate policies as code  it can be hard to switch to using the  native cas certificate issuance controls  so you'll need a way to connect the two  and you're in luck because we have a  proxy solution  by adding a plugin for vault you can  instruct it to act as a proxy issuing  certificates through google's cas backed  by vault secured secrets  it works by generating a private key and  certificate signing request or getting  the request from a user to deliver  certificates through vault with cis  issuing them behind the scenes  the plugin can't create or delete any  certificate authorities or manage any  other parts of the life cycle it just  allows you to connect vault to cas so  you can natively issue certificates  without rewriting your services  the github repo linked below has more  detailed instructions for how to set up  the plugin and get all of the pieces  connected  once you have hashicorp vault already  installed and a ca setup on cas you're  ready to deploy the plugin code the  plugin code is open source and if needed  can be forked and be self-maintained or  you can send prs to google cloud for  maintenance  you'll need to have a user or service  account that vault uses and allow it to  generate and revoke certificates  we recommend using custom iam roles here  to give the vault service account the  minimal set of permissions required  which would include create and update  for the private ca dot certificates  permission set there's a link in the  description for how to create custom  roles  once you've set up the plugin you can  now let your administrators take  advantage of the existing workflows and  access controls within vault to control  certificate permissions  you also enjoy the flexibility of  defining who can request certifications  and what limits to place on the  certificates themselves  if you're using vault and want to try  cas check out the plugin on github read  through the detailed readme there and  let us know how we can further improve  it  [Music]

